      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just before committing I am thinking that since we use DAWN_CHECK, would the user be completely unable to open the browser if they have a bad cache for e.g. Graphite\u0027s shader? Does Chrome embeds a routine to help recovering from such status, like clearing all cache if multiple crashes occurs?",
