      "writtenOn": "2025-07-14T16:07:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The GPU cache is supposed to be cleared after repeated crashes (though I can\u0027t find the exact code that does it right now).\n\nStill, you\u0027re probably right that it shouldn\u0027t be a CHECK. An assert + log error + skip the entry is probably better.",
      "parentUuid": "94b52e33_9bdc0d4f",
      "revId": "0d246ef102218883a2007ab87a24ae5055f1b74a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
