      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T06:32:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shell we make it a follow up if we are going to change the `DAWN_CHECK` to more robustness check? IIRC `DAWN_CHECK` can help collecting the cache collapse rate in field by submitting crash report, can we send the report without crashing the GPU?",
      "parentUuid": "94b52e33_9bdc0d4f",
      "revId": "0d246ef102218883a2007ab87a24ae5055f1b74a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
