      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T13:33:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Already we have some code that generates crash reports (without crashing) on errors: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:gpu/command_buffer/service/dawn_context_provider.cc;l\u003d109-129;drc\u003dea3bd0aab9dc634a1416592034a4bd316e64df31\n\nI think it makes sense to remove the CHECK before landing.",
      "parentUuid": "9b3b4a9c_0b87f8da",
      "revId": "0d246ef102218883a2007ab87a24ae5055f1b74a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
